  "description": "A lightweight Backend-for-Frontend (BFF) authentication library for ASP.NET Core built on Cookie Authentication and OpenID Connect (OIDC). It simplifies secure authentication setup for modern SPA applications by enforcing server-side session management and eliminating token storage in the frontend.",
  "id": "Methrax.Bff.AspNetCore",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-08-08T06:25:36.873Z",
