  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added support for server-side session management, token persistence, and options validation.\n\n\t\t\tFeatures:\n\t\t\t- Added SaveTokens configuration support\n\t\t\t- Added EnableServerSideSessions configuration support\n\t\t\t- Added ITicketStore integration support\n\t\t\t- Added eager options validation at application startup (BackendForFrontendOptionsValidator)\n\t\t\t- Improved support for production BFF architectures\n\n\t\t\tBreaking Changes:\n\t\t\t- Configuration section name changed from \"BffAuthentication\" to \"Methrax:BffAuthentication\". Existing appsettings.json files must be updated accordingly.\n\n\t\t\tNotes:\n\t\t\t- All new runtime features are opt-in and disabled by default.",
